      "content": "i know you say it's fixable but it's not. i looked at the numbers. even if i get a better job, the interest alone eats everything. my wife is working double shifts just to cover my mistakes. if i just... disappeared, that's one less mouth to feed, one less person to pay for, and she could use my life insurance to actually give the kids a future. it's just math at this point. it's the only way the math actually works out in their favor.",
